     "text": "```json\n{\"reachable\": false, \"rationale\": \"The target crownData:exfiltrate is no longer reachable. It is an OR over four steps, and each one is cut off by the defences. (1) codeRepo:collection is blocked directly. (2) shareMount:collection depends only on backupHost:lateralMovement, which is blocked. (3) dbReplica:collection needs one of three parents, and all fail. serviceAccount:privilegeEscalation is AND and needs vpnSession:authenticate, which is AND and needs the blocked ciRunner:exploitPublicApp. domainAdmin:privilegeEscalation is AND and needs dbLogin:authenticate, which needs the blocked browserStore:credentialAccess; its other parent apiToken:authenticate also needs ciRunner. monitoringHost:lateralMovement depends only on rdpLogin:authenticate, which is AND and needs the blocked browserStore:credentialAccess. (4) vaultRead:collection depends only on domainAdmin and serviceAccount, both unreachable as shown.\"}\n```"
